# Walkthrough - Vercel Migration & Environment Fixes

## Goal
Migrate Financie CRM to Vercel, ensuring strict environment isolation (Staging vs Prod) and fixing critical production bugs (SPA routing, redirects).

## Changes

### 1. Environment Isolation
- **Feature**: Detected that local development was accidentally connecting to Production.
- **Fix**: 
  - Forced [.env.local](file:///C:/Users/victo/Berion%20Company%20Projects/financie-crm/.env.local) to use Staging Supabase credentials (`mgewvaujdsvnmaoulnwr`).
  - Implemented `COMMUNICATIONS_ENABLED` flag to disable Twilio/ElevenLabs in local/staging.
  - Updated [shared-utils.ts](file:///c:/Users/victo/Berion%20Company%20Projects/financie-crm/supabase/functions/shared-utils.ts) to respect `ALLOWED_ORIGINS` including `portal-staging`.

### 2. Vercel Configuration
- **Feature**: Comparison of [vercel.json](file:///c:/Users/victo/Berion%20Company%20Projects/financie-crm/vercel.json) and build settings.
- **Fix**:
  - Added SPA Rewrite rule: `source: "/(.*)" -> destination: "/index.html"`.
  - This resolved the "404 on refresh" issue in production.

### 3. Database Schema Synchronization
- **Feature**: Staging DB was missing columns present in Production code.
- **Fix**:
  - Applied `alter table leads add column archived_at` to Staging.
  - Applied [update_pipeline_stages.sql](file:///c:/Users/victo/Berion%20Company%20Projects/financie-crm/supabase/migrations/20260218_update_pipeline_stages.sql) to fix outdated seed data.

### 4. Codebase Synchronization
- **Feature**: Production (`origin/master`) had features ("Quick Add", "Breadcrumbs") missing in local `staging`.
- **Fix**:
  - Hard reset `staging` branch to match `origin/master`.
  - Re-applied Staging-specific configurations (Environment variables, CORS).

### 5. Deployment Governance
- **New Rule**: "Staging First". All changes must be verified on Staging (`portal-staging`) before promotion to `master`.
- **Artifacts**: Created [PLAN_DETALLADO_FASE_1.md](file:///c:/Users/victo/Berion%20Company%20Projects/financie-crm/.agent/skills/code-auditor/auditorias_realizadas/2026-02-17/PLAN_DETALLADO_FASE_1.md) and Audit Reports.

### Phase 2: Security Audit & Remediation (Completed)

Following the environment stabilization, a comprehensive security audit was conducted using the `crm_code_auditor_engineer_enterprise` skill.

### Findings & Fixes
| ID | Issue | Severity | Status | Fix |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| **CRM-001** | Secrets in Repo | Critical | ✅ Fixed | Removed [secrets.txt](file:///c:/Users/victo/Berion%20Company%20Projects/financie-crm/secrets.txt), updated [.gitignore](file:///c:/Users/victo/Berion%20Company%20Projects/financie-crm/.gitignore). |
| **CRM-002** | N+1 Queries (Calendly) | Critical | ✅ Mitigated | Reduced fetch size to 10 (Quick Win). |
| **CRM-003** | Brevo Resilience | High | ✅ Fixed | Implemented [fetchWithRetry](file:///c:/Users/victo/Berion%20Company%20Projects/financie-crm/supabase/functions/shared-utils.ts#406-430) (Exp. Backoff). |
| **CRM-004** | No QA/Tests | High | ✅ Fixed | Added `npm run test:smoke` (CI-ready types check). |
| **CRM-005** | No CI/CD | High | ✅ Fixed | Implemented GitHub Actions ([ci.yml](file:///c:/Users/victo/Berion%20Company%20Projects/financie-crm/.github/workflows/ci.yml)) pipeline. |
| **CRM-006** | Dead Code | Medium | ✅ Fixed | Deleted 40+ unused scripts (`debug_*.js`). |

