- [INFORME_FINAL_REMEDIACION.md](file:///c:/Users/victo/Berion%20Company%20Projects/financie-crm/.agent/skills/code-auditor/auditorias_realizadas/18%20de%20febrero%202026/INFORME_FINAL_REMEDIACION.md) (Final Status)
